+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is required on all builds, including development builds. An earlier workaround that disabled certificate verification in dev builds was explicitly retired ("Let's not use that workaround - need verification on all builds"), so no dev-only exception is currently in effect.
